      "message": "I reverted a decent amount of changes, and decided to remove the buffer lock and continue using the device-wide lock for now. I realized to get it right in the case of a submit, I would need to acquire all the locks of all the buffers, and I would also need to acquire them in a consistent order so it was too much for now. I think probably, the \"correct\" way is to have the lock on the queue instead, but deferring that change for now. There\u0027s some follow up changes I will be doing to clean up some cases where we may re-entrantly acquire the lock, but those cases are invalid uses right now anyways so wanted to unblock this first. Please take another look at everything, thanks!",
